---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Strong Towns Worcester, MA | Building a More Resilient City">
    <section class="pt-12 md:pt-16 pb-6">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
                <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-stw-primary mb-4">
                    Strong Towns Worcester
                </h1>
                <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
                    Empowering Worcester to build a resilient and inclusive community where walking, biking, and incremental development thrive. Together we advocate and act to create vibrant neighborhoods and transportation freedom.
                </p>
                <a href="https://discord.gg/JszTyuxxaZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block bg-stw-primary hover:opacity-90 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl">
                    Join our Discord
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

					<p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
						We are a community of advocates in Worcester, MA, part of the national
						<a href="https://www.strongtowns.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-primary underline font-medium">Strong Towns</a>
						movement. We advocate for fiscally responsible community led solutions to make Worcester more livable and resilient.
					</p>

					<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
						<a href="#join" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-stw-primary text-white font-semibold py-3 px-5 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:opacity-95 focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-stw-primary/30">
							Join the Conversation
						</a>

                <!-- Goal 3 -->
                <div class="bg-stw-primary p-8 rounded-3xl hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-4xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-sm">
                        🏗️
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-stw-secondary mb-3">Local Accountability</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-left">
We actively support the <a href="https://www.worcesterma.gov/worcester-now-next" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">Now | Next Citywide Plan</a> and the <a href="https://www.worcesterma.gov/mobility/vision-zero" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">Vision Zero initiative</a> to make Worcester more self-reliant, accessible, and affordable. By championing these specific plans, we ensure our tax dollars go toward <a href="https://www.strongtowns.org/housing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">building housing</a> and infrastructure that offer a <a href="https://www.strongtowns.org/accounting" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">real return for our community</a>. This focus on results ensures every resident can participate in our local economy and contributes to a more resilient future for everyone.                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>